# INVLINK.KEY - a key script of INVWIN (SRC/WIN/INVWIN.C) over a link to
# INVSERV on the data TEST/KEYS/SEED.REQ seeds, run by TEST/WIN/winser.sh
# (/COM1), TEST/WIN/winnb.sh (/NET RISRV), TEST/WIN/winmbx.sh (/MBOX:
# on the server's share) and TEST/INTEG/wintcp.sh (/TCP: through
# INVTCP): a login at level 3, the item list, with the preview of its
# selected item beside it on the links whose requests are fast (NetBIOS,
# TCP) and alone on the others, an item in view mode, CTRL-/ choosing
# every row, which walks the list for its keys on every link, and CTRL-\
# the focus row alone again, item 2's parts, none, and ESC back to the
# item list on item 2, sought there on the fast links and found on the
# first page, with no request more, on the others, View > Pane beside
# the list, which hides the preview on the first and shows it, the same
# lines, on the others, and once more, which puts it back, twice more
# with the ESC of an A line, typed as the preview's load starts where
# the entry shows it, so that the yield of its first request meets it
# and the load stops before the next, the preview saying that it did not
# load, and a key for the list, where it does nothing, where the entry
# hides it, the
# assemblies, none, and the loans and holds, none, each with its empty
# pane on the fast links and alone on the others, the location
# tree, the selected location's contents beside it on the fast links and
# on the serial line, whose settings ask for them (TEST/WIN/PANE1.CFG,
# WINPANE.LOC=1), and the tree alone on the mailbox, the categories
# (Items > Browse by category), the first one's items beside them on the
# fast links and alone on the others, those items as a screen of their
# own by ENTER and the categories again by ESC, log-out and the end
# from the login dialog.  The password goes
# in key by key, so that the script, which lies in the Windows machine's
# memory, holds it nowhere for the memory searches of winser.sh and
# winmbx.sh.
# Every mode of Windows writes TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVSER.SNP over the serial
# line, TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVNB.SNP over NetBIOS,
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVMBX.SNP over the mailbox, and Windows for Workgroups
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVTCP.SNP over TCP.
T ADMIN
K TAB
K SHIFT-R E T R O 1 9 8 6
K ENTER
S LIST
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ESC
S BACK
K CTRL-SLASH
S ALL
K CTRL-BSLASH
S ONE
K DOWN ALT-C P
S PARTS
K ESC
S PBACK
K UP
K ALT-V P
S PANE
K ALT-V P
S PANE2
K ALT-V P
A ESC
S STOP
K ALT-V P
A ESC
S STOP2
K ALT-I A
S ASSY
K ALT-I O
S LOANS
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
K ALT-I T
S CATS
K ENTER
S CATITEMS
K ESC
S CATBACK
K ALT-F L
S LOGOUT
K ESC
S GONE
